{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:32:06+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zeta Leporis RTS", "steam_appid": 2445160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the asteroids surrounding the star Zeta Leporis, competing cybernetic vestiges of a dead civilization follow their infinite mandate to expand, exploit, and exterminate. Eternally adhering to the operational templates from the Last Great War, they interpret any life or machine form that deviates from their own build as an aberration that requires eradication. The efficiency of the machine and the mindlessness of total war...a constant cycle of rebuilding and destruction, until, some day, there will be nothing left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.poster.avif?t=1783373579\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.webm?t=1783373579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.mp4?t=1783373579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zeta Leporis RTS</strong> currently features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode featuring highly customizable random map skirmish matches with up to 11  capable AI opponents with adjustable difficulty settings. The demo offers a 4 player free-for-all match with no customization. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters, frigates, destroyers, cruisers, battleships, missile corvettes, defense turrets, battlestations, assimilators, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A literal resource transfer system unique to the RTS genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build queues and rally points, dynamic control groups, hotkeys and a navigable minimap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable resource collectors and turrets, and other researchable technology. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving and loading games; not present in the demo.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A basic tutorial to help you get started.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the asteroids surrounding the star Zeta Leporis, competing cybernetic vestiges of a dead civilization follow their infinite mandate to expand, exploit, and exterminate. Eternally adhering to the operational templates from the Last Great War, they interpret any life or machine form that deviates from their own build as an aberration that requires eradication. The efficiency of the machine and the mindlessness of total war...a constant cycle of rebuilding and destruction, until, some day, there will be nothing left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.poster.avif?t=1783373579\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.webm?t=1783373579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/extras/fed31557f99c9ccab265b6de7421216c.mp4?t=1783373579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zeta Leporis RTS</strong> currently features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode featuring highly customizable random map skirmish matches with up to 11  capable AI opponents with adjustable difficulty settings. The demo offers a 4 player free-for-all match with no customization. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters, frigates, destroyers, cruisers, battleships, missile corvettes, defense turrets, battlestations, assimilators, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A literal resource transfer system unique to the RTS genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build queues and rally points, dynamic control groups, hotkeys and a navigable minimap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable resource collectors and turrets, and other researchable technology. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving and loading games; not present in the demo.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A basic tutorial to help you get started.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A sci-fi real-time strategy game. An existential war among asteroids in classic RTS style. Build and defend, produce and upgrade, attack and annihilate!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Russian, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/ecad3f6b9830848466e634f74d1691c6a921231e/header.jpg?t=1783373579", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/e95a26dd0e0beb827daa9480f056151fb1b7a51a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783373579", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445160/e95a26dd0e0beb827daa9480f056151fb1b7a51a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783373579", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sy